{"id":"A0-resource-26","title":"Calligraphy L0-02 · ‎ي‎ e ‎و: consonants, long vowels, diphthongs","blocks":[{"type":"heading","text":"Calligraphy L0-02 · ⁧ي⁩ and ⁧و⁩ : consonants, long vowels, diphthongs"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⁧ي⁩ yāʾ · y / ī · /j/, [iː] Near palatale; after kasra marks the ī Long. Two points below."},{"type":"arabic","text":"⁧ـيـيـيـي⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Initial isolationMediafinal"},{"type":"arabic","text":"⁧ـيـيـيـيـيـيـيـي⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⁧و⁩ wāw · w / ū · /w/, [uː] Nearby labiovelar; after ḍamma marks the ū Long. It's not connected to the next one."},{"type":"arabic","text":"⁧ـوو⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Isolate (Final)"},{"type":"arabic","text":"⁧ـووـووـووـوو⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Keywords home bayt ⁧بَيْتبَيْتبَيْت⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"buyūt houses ⁧بُيُوتبُيُوتبُيُوت⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"baytī my home ⁧بَيْتِيبَيْتِيبَيْتِي⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bintī my daughter ⁧بِنْتِيبِنْتِيبِنْتِي⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tīn figs ⁧تِينتِينتِين⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tūt mulberry ⁧تُوتتُوتتُوت⁩ ṯawb dress, robe ⁧ثَوْبثَوْبثَوْب⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ṯiyāb clothes ⁧ثِيَابثِيَابثِيَاب⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bayna tra, fra ⁧بَيْنَبَيْنَبَيْنَ⁩"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"wa e ⁧وَوَوَ⁩"}],"contentLanguage":"en","translationStatus":"machine-translated"}